  "name": "Petrify",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/magic/earth/strike-body-stone-crumble.webp",
  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to force a PC within Far range to make an Instinct Reaction Roll. On a success, the target marks a Stress. On a failure, the target becomes Stiff . If the target is already Stiff , they become Petrified. While Stiff , the PC must mark a Stress each time they act until they take a rest or the @Lookup[@name] is defeated. While Petrified, the PC can't act. The Petrified condition can be cleared only by applying @Lookup[@name] saliva to the target.</p>",
